Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Optimize app for mobile

- viewport-fit=cover + PWA meta tags for iPhone notch/home-indicator support
- Safe-area insets on topbar and page padding via env(safe-area-inset-*)
- Fix iOS input auto-zoom: set font-size 16px on text-input and editor
- File sidebar replaced with slide-up bottom drawer on mobile
  - "Files" toggle button in topbar (hidden on desktop)
  - Backdrop overlay with tap-to-dismiss
  - Drawer auto-closes when a file is selected
- Larger touch targets: file-item, back-btn, restore-btn (min 44px)
- Modals become bottom sheets on mobile (slide up from bottom edge)
- Consistent safe-area bottom padding throughout

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FWksNavChAtxifMa2DCfS4
